  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b65a981db6ffa147946662628c707ac, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vance's Contract
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  liveLoadMode: 0
  allowVehicleCargo: 1
  minimumLoadedCargo: 4
  cargoUnlockProgressionId: VanceNPC
  cargoUnlockAfterDialoguePhaseIndex: 3
  cargoLoadedNPCPhaseId: Project Briefing
  contractID: VancesContract
  efficiencyStarBudgetRatio: 0.85
  strengthStarMaxStress: 60
  contractMap: 0
  countsTowardMapAchievements: 1
  isStoryModeContract: 1
  isTutorialContract: 0
  autoCollectReward: 0
  featureUnlockRewards: []
  clientName: Vance
  jobDescription: We need a bridge across this ravine!
  budget: 100000
  liveLoadWeight: 1500
  bridgeSpan: 3
  allowedMaterials: []
  hiddenTools: 
  hiddenMaterials: []
  enforceMaxStress: 0
  maxAllowedStress: 100
  isTimeAttack: 0
  timeAttackDuration: 60
  winCondition: 0
  requiredIntactTime: 5
  goldReward: 500
  expReward: 100
  offerDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - This bridge will form the first half of a new supply route to the community.
    - It needs to connect the factory road to the supply point at the middle ravine.
    - The loaded vehicle is heavier than the ones you have handled before.
    - <b><#E09500>As that weight moves across, different parts of the bridge may
      respond in different ways</color></b>.
    - <b><#E09500>Pay attention to how the structural members behave during the test</color></b>.
    - Watch how they work together while the cargo vehicle crosses.
    - If the bridge can carry the complete load safely, the supplies can reach the
      middle ravine.
    - If you're ready, take the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - The cargo is secured and the required live load is ready.
    - Take your time with the design.
    - Watch how the different parts of the bridge respond when the loaded vehicle
      crosses.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - That's the first part of the route open.
    - The loaded vehicle made it from the factory to the middle ravine safely.
    - You also proved that the bridge can carry the actual cargo the community needs,
      not just an empty vehicle.
    - But the delivery is only halfway there.
    - The road ends at the next ravine, and the community is still on the other side.
    - <b>Silas<b> is responsible for the projects beyond this point.
    - He is waiting near the middle supply area, where the vehicle stopped.
    - Take the contract record to him. He'll show you what is needed to finish the
      route.
    - Good work, {PlayerName}.
